title: Sparc_PostSorting
position: -1026,461
---
<<set $OverrideMode = false>>
<<SetNarrator GameManager $Sparc Default>>
{$Sparc}: Great work sorting out that trash! Now we just need to take that trash and process it! 
    ->How do I do that?
<<SetNarrator GameManager $Sparc Delight>>
{$Sparc}: It's easy! You just walk up to the yellow bin and take out a piece of trash!

<<jump Sparc_MachineExplain>>
===

title: Sparc_MachineExplain
position: -765,460
---
<<SetNarrator GameManager $Sparc Displease>>
{$Sparc}: When there were people on the island, the machines here used to help them make the island a better place...
<<SetNarrator GameManager $Sparc Delight>>
{$Sparc}: But now that you're here, we can get started again!
<<SetNarrator GameManager $Sparc Default>>
{$Sparc}: *bzzt* As you can see, there are many different types of machines here, each with their own use. 
{$Sparc}: Each piece of trash needs to be processed by several machines before it can be recycled.
{$Sparc}: So let's get to it! Head on over to the yellow Bin Bot and grab some trash, then come back to me!
    -> Got it!
<<ForcedOutlineEnd SparcNPC>>
===

